    thinking: "**Developing the Mockup**\n\nI\'m now shifting gears towards creating an interactive dashboard mockup. I\'m excited to develop a React component for the visual system. That seems like the right approach for interactive SVG illustrations for the dashboard mockup structure and high-quality icons. It will be much easier to maintain.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I will now build the `/src/components/AIAssistant.tsx` component. It includes:\n1. An interactive, intelligent chat panel where potential clients can converse with \"Spacevip AI\" to formulate their system requirements.\n2. Under-the-hood integrations with our secure server `/api/gemini/chat` API endpoint.\n3. Interactive preset templates (frequently requested systems) to spark instant brainstorming.\n4. Smooth sliding animations with `motion/react` to make the interaction high-fidelity and premium."
