    modified_response: "I will now build the high-converting contact and intelligent proposal form `/src/components/ContactForm.tsx`. It implements:\n1. A smooth multi-step questionnaire (personal/company info followed by system needs, budget level, and urgency indicators).\n2. Advanced state handling that saves submissions to local storage so prospective clients can review previously generated plans.\n3. Live integrations with `/api/gemini/blueprint` to generate custom tech architectures instantly on submission.\n4. An elegant proposal viewer showcasing Category, Core Modules, Tailored Tech Stacks, ROI metrics, and architectural write-ups."
